      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-295917",
      ":question/problem": "Triangle $DEF$ is similar to triangle $UVW$, such that $D$, $E$, and $F$ correspond to $U$, $V$, and $W$, respectively. The length of each side of triangle $UVW$ is $3$ times the length of its corresponding side in triangle $DEF$. The measure of side $EF^(\u2015)$ is $12$. What is the measure of side $VW^(\u2015)$?"
